# Worker-only Novofon Data API credential.
#
# Copy to .worker.secrets.env on the VPS and run chmod 600 on it. This file is
# ignored by Git and delivered only to the `worker` container. It contains no
# webhook path/body secret and no Call API configuration.
#
# Prefer a distinct, least-privileged Data API token. If Novofon offers only a
# combined token, its value may have to match .api.secrets.env temporarily, but
# the two files must remain separate and access to each file must be reviewed.
NOVOFON_ACCESS_TOKEN=replace_with_data_api_token
